OL,4,CMyanmar committed genocide against its 
OL,5,CRohingya minority, UN's top court rules
OL,6,GMyanmar committed genocide against its 
OL,7,GRohingya minority population, the      
OL,8,GInternational Court of Justice (ICJ)   
OL,9,Gfinds.                                 
OL,11,FThe verdict - decided by a panel of 15 
OL,12,Fjudges from around the world - is the  
OL,13,Ffirst time a state has ever been found 
OL,14,Fguilty by an international court of    
OL,15,Fcommitting genocide.                   
OL,17,FIn his summarising remarks, Judge Yuji 
OL,18,FIwasawa says Myanmar had the           
OL,19,F"intention to destroy" a substantial   
OL,20,Fpart of the Rohingya.                  
OL,22,                                   G1/2 
