OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CMyanmar committed genocide against its 
OL,5,CRohingya minority, UN's top court rules
OL,6,FHe adds that it engaged in "extensive  
OL,7,Fdestruction of evidence", and failed   
OL,8,Fto investigate, prosecute and punish   
OL,9,Fpeople who committed genocide offences.
OL,11,FIn 2017, a military crackdown killed   
OL,12,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more  
OL,13,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority 
OL,14,FMyanmar for neighbouring Bangladesh.   
OL,16,FMyanmar had denied the claims made in  
OL,17,Fthe case brought to the court by The   
OL,18,FGambia, and said its forces were       
OL,19,Fresponding to attacks by armed groups. 
OL,22,                                   G2/2 
